<title>FRANCE: Bancaire Q1 net attrib profit 307 mln Fr.</title>
<headline>Bancaire Q1 net attrib profit 307 mln Fr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable profit		    307  no comparison</p>
<p>    Total credits distributed	     20,302, up six percent</p>
<p>     - France				   15,883, up two percent</p>
<p>     - Abroad				    4,419, up 25 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Cie Bancaire gave its results in a statement. The company reported a net attributable profit of 111 million francs a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
